5	OD 531 BGF	images/Панель_4mv4Dwc.webp	<p><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Современный духовой шкаф</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— не просто “печка”.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Это мини-ресторан у вас дома.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Познакомьтесь с моделью,</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">которая меняет представление о домашней готовке:</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Air Fry — забудьте про жир и масло! Готовьте курочку, картошку, наггетсы с хрустящей корочкой и минимумом калорий.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Программа для пиццы + камень в комплекте — как в настоящей дровяной печи. Пицца с хрустящей основой всего за 8 минут.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Разморозка — забудьте про микроволновку.</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Быстро, равномерно и без потери вкуса.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Три уровня + 3 противня в комплекте —</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">запекайте целую курицу, гарнир и десерт одновременно.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Объём 88 л — большой, но энергоэффективный. Поместится всё: от утки до барашка на Новый год.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Тройное стекло + доводчики дверей — безопасно даже для детей, дверь не хлопает и не обжигает.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Керамика внутри — легко моется, не</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">впитывает запахи, не царапается.</span></span></p>	34990.00	0.00	0	Publi