7	OD 532 BGF	images/Шкаф.webp	<p><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Современный духовой шкаф</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— не просто “печка”.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Это мини-ресторан у вас дома.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Познакомьтесь с моделью,</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">которая меняет представление о домашней готовке:</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Air Fry — забудьте про жир и масло! Готовьте курочку, картошку, наггетсы с хрустящей корочкой и минимумом калорий.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Программа для пиццы + камень в комплекте — как в настоящей дровяной печи. Пицца с хрустящей основой всего за 8 минут.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Разморозка — забудьте про микроволновку.</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Быстро, равномерно и без потери вкуса.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Три уровня + 3 противня в комплекте —</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">запекайте целую курицу, гарнир и десерт одновременно.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Объём 88 л — большой, но энергоэффективный. Поместится всё: от утки до барашка на Новый год.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Тройное стекло + доводчики дверей — безопасно даже для детей, дверь не хлопает и не обжигает.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— Керамика внутри — легко моется, не</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">впитывает запахи, не царапается.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">⸻</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">📌 Почему это важно:</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">✔ Удобство на каждый день</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">✔ Экономия времени и электроэнергии</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">✔ Профессиональный результат у вас дома</span></span></p>	34490.00	0.00	0	Published	f	SKU33155	od-532-bgf	2026-01-24 09:37:42+00	1	\N	0.00	\N
6	OD 531 BGW	images/Панель.webp	<p><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Когда у вас такой духовой шкаф,</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">вкусно — это просто.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Хрустящая картошка без масла?</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Fry режим — жарит воздухом, а не жиром.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Пицца, как из печи?</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Есть спецпрограмма + камень в комплекте.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Забыли разморозить мясо?</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Встроенная разморозка справится</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">быстрее и безопаснее, чем микроволновка.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Любите готовить на всю семью?</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Внутри 88 литров объёма</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">и 3 листа — ужин, десерт и хлеб можно делать одновременно.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Не хотите хлопающих дверей и горячего стекла?</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Тут всё продумано: доводчики, тройное стекло, максимальная безопасность.</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">И, конечно, биокерамическое покрытие</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">— чистится легче, чем вы успеете остыть после ужина</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">⸻</span></span><br><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Почему этот шкаф — умный выбор:</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">1. Экономит время (режимы + объём = скорость).</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">2. Бережёт здоровье (Air Fry и керамика).</span></span><br><span style="background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(12,16,20);"><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">3. Делает кухню безопасной и комфортной.</span></span></p>	34990.00	0.00	0	Published	f	SKU44893	od-531-bgw	2026-01-24 09:34:58+00	1	\N	0.00	\N
